                                "sense_id": "56c55d23-61f1-35b5-95e9-164e19e3a74c",
                                "text": "His patroonship of Rensellaerwick lay immediately below Fort Aurania, and extended for several miles on each side of the Hudson, beside embracing the mountainous region of the Helderberg."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fea8f9a4-9386-431e-89a5-8776d4847f0c",
                                "sense_id": "56c55d23-61f1-35b5-95e9-164e19e3a74c",
                                "text": "It was a protest against the patroonship system, which went back to the 1600s when the Dutch ruled New York, a system where […] ‘a few families, intricately intermarried, controlled the destinies of three hundred thousand people and ruled in almost kingly splendor near two million acres of land.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
